@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174/

### GET All inventory

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Low stock only

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory?isLowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST Inventory

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "db5b9a9e-9f69-4054-87a6-8baedda28921",
  "name": "Szampon szpontex 1L",
  "description": "Wysokiej jakości szampon o zapachu wiśniowym",
  "unit": "Litr",
  "stock": 50,
  "minStock": 10
}

### PUT Inventory

PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/dbe38f2d-847d-4708-8c6d-ca76e76d4a74
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "c8496ded-93df-40a3-9d95-713a5fde6d07",
  "name": "Szampon szpontex update",
  "description": "Zaktualizowany opis szamponu",
  "unit": "Litr",
  "stock": 150,
  "minStock": 20
}